    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is preparing for a job. However, she gets stressed out when things don't go her way. In addition, her family scold her for not getting a job. Under extreme stress, the girl ends up exploding due to mental pressure. That night, after an argument with her family, she has a nightmare...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the girl be able to get out of the nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from all kinds of traps and monsters and find a girl's dream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game in 2d flatformer format with a total of 4 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you play the game, the story goes on.</p>",
